    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39623" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">purgātor</span></b> , ōris,
			m.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>a cleanser</i>, <i>purger</i> (post - class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cloacarum, Firm. Math. 8, 20: ferarum,</span>”
				<i>an exterminator of wild beasts</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">App. Mag. p. 288, 26</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: animae, Aug. Civ. Dei, 10,
		10.</div>
